  RAG Knowledge Query Terminal

  Query:
    setkb <kb>                    Set default knowledgebase
    query -q "question"           Query (uses default KB)
    kb list                       List knowledgebases
    history                       View query history

  Conversations:
    new <name>                    Start new conversation
    use <name>                    Switch conversation
    list / current                List or show active

